>>> /dev/rdisk/dsk0a: CAN'T CHECK FILE SYSTEM.
>>> Error: /dev/rdisk/dsk0g is an invalid device or cannot be opened.
>>> Can't open /dev/rdisk/dsk0g: No such device or address
>>> /dev/rdisk/dsk0g: CAN'T CHECK FILE SYSTEM.
>>> THE FOLLOWING FILE SYSTEM HAD AN UNEXPECTED INCONSISTENCY:
